    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Can you guess where this place is? Thinking of somewhere outside Karachi? Wrong! This is not located on the outskirts of the city, rather situated right in the heart of the city, in the country's most technologically advanced simulation centre. Surprised? That's how the post-RN BScN students felt when they explored this area during briefing for the first of, hopefully many, rural community-based simulation at CIMEABAD in CIME courtyard.",
